# fresh_resume_roundtrip: suspend_roundtrip's guest suspended in one process and resumed in a new one, in every setup and every pair of different setups (a migration between hosts configured differently). The new process rebuilds the root FIFO at the blob's counts, child FIFO 1, tasks 0 and 1 and the display, replaying the cursor glyph and show, and raises one interrupt; P comes back from its guest pages, which rvg_device_finish_suspend wrote back. The resuming side's observations depend on its own setup only.
